# AGENTS.md

## Stack
FastAPI service, Python 3.12, managed with `uv`. Async throughout — except
`app/legacy/`, which is sync-only; do not convert it.

## Commands
- Install: `uv sync`             # not pip — the project is uv-managed
- Run: `uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload`
- Test (all): `uv run pytest`
- Test (one): `uv run pytest tests/test_x.py::test_name`
- Lint + format + types: `uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format . && uv run mypy app`

## Testing
- Integration tests need a local Postgres: `docker compose up -d db` first, or
  they fail with an opaque connection error.
- Mock outbound HTTP with `respx`; never mock the database — use the test DB.

## Boundaries
- Never edit files under `app/_generated/` (regenerated from the OpenAPI spec).
- Never commit `.env` or anything under `secrets/`.

## Specialized rules — read the file when its trigger applies
- Adding/modifying an API endpoint → read `docs/api.md`
- Changing models or writing an Alembic migration → read `docs/database.md`
